---
title: "Acting II"
code: "CST-132"
category: "communication-studies-and-theatre"
credits: "3"
prerequisites:
  - "2026/CST-131"
corequisites: []
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisite: CST 131"
---

Extends students' understanding of the craft of acting. Builds on Acting I skills through individual and group text work that include practice listening, point-of-view recognition, personalization, and text analysis. Part II of II. Lecture 2 hours. Laboratory 2 hour. Total 4 hours per week.
